        </dd>
        <dt>
          Foreground workspace
        </dt>
        <dd>
          None
        </dd>
        <dt>
          Selected pet
        </dt>
        <dd>
          Not used by this action
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <button
        disabled=""
      >
        Preview setting
      </button>
      <button>
        Read current settings
      </button>
      <section
        aria-label="Last read settings"
        class="nidofy-settings-observed"
      >
        <p>
          Read-only snapshot of the current conversation, selected pet and attention. Refresh after changes elsewhere. This is not an action receipt; choose a new preview explicitly.
        </p>
        <p>
          Read at (local time):\u0020
          <time
            datetime="2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z"
          >
            10/13/2026, 4:00:00 AM
          </time>
        </p>
        <dl
          class="nidofy-settings-target"
        >
          <dt>
            Companion tone for next turn
          </dt>
          <dd>
            Enabled
          </dd>
          <dt>
            Currently followed conversation
          </dt>
          <dd>
            observed-session
          </dd>
          <dt>
            Desktop pets master switch
          </dt>
          <dd>
            Enabled
          </dd>
          <dt>
            Selected pet
          </dt>
          <dd>
            1
          </dd>
          <dt>
            Instance state
          </dt>
          <dd>
            Enabled
          </dd>
          <dt>
            Bound conversation
          </dt>
          <dd>
            observed-session
          </dd>
          <dt>
            Pet bubbles
          </dt>
          <dd>
            Muted
          </dd>
        </dl>
        <p>
          Optional tone applies from the next conversation turn. Code and formal reports keep their normal style. It does not change permissions.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </details>
</DocumentFragment>
`;

exports[`reads only on explicit choice, shows original settings and withdraws failed refresh in zh > explicit owner settings snapshot 1`] = `
<DocumentFragment>
  <details
    class="nidofy-control-fold"
    open=""
  >
    <summary>
      用一句话设置
    </summary>
    <div
      class="nidofy-detail nidofy-settings"
    >
      <p>
        选择下列一项动作或输入一项有限指令。选择仅填入指令，仍需单独预览并确认；不会调用模型。
      </p>
      <label
        for=":r7:"
      >
        可用动作
      </label>
      <select
        id=":r7:"
      >
        <option
          value=""
        >
          选择一项动作
        </option>
        <option
          value="follow"
        >
          关注当前会话
        </option>
        <option
          value="unfollow"
        >
          停止关注
        </option>
        <option
          value="connections"
        >
          打开连接设置
        </option>
        <option
          value="builds"
        >
          打开工程工作台
        </option>
        <option
          value="pets"
        >
          打开桌宠设置
        </option>
        <option
          value="bind"
        >
          绑定桌宠
        </option>
        <option
          value="unbind"
        >
          解绑桌宠
        </option>
        <option
          value="mute"
        >
          静音桌宠
        </option>
        <option
          value="unmute"
        >
          取消桌宠静音
        </option>
        <option
          value="interact"
        >
          向桌宠挥手
        </option>
        <option
          value="toneOn"
        >
          启用伙伴口吻
        </option>
        <option
          value="toneOff"
        >
          关闭伙伴口吻
        </option>
      </select>
      <label>
        输入一项设置
        <input
          maxlength="512"
          value=""
        />
      </label>
      <dl
        class="nidofy-settings-target"
      >
        <dt>
          当前会话
        </dt>
        <dd>
          无
        </dd>
        <dt>
          当前工作区
        </dt>
        <dd>
          无
        </dd>
        <dt>
          所选桌宠
        </dt>
        <dd>
          此动作不使用桌宠
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <button
        disabled=""
      >
        预览设置
      </button>
      <button>
        读取当前设置
      </button>
      <section
        aria-label="上次读取的设置"
        class="nidofy-settings-observed"
      >
        <p>
          当前会话、所选桌宠和关注目标的只读快照；在其他地方更改后请重新读取。这不是操作回执，请明确选择新的预览。
        </p>
        <p>
          读取时间（本地时间）：\u0020
          <time
            datetime="2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z"
          >
            2026/10/13 04:00:00
          </time>
        </p>
        <dl
          class="nidofy-settings-target"
        >
          <dt>
            下一回合的伙伴口吻
          </dt>
          <dd>
            已启用
          </dd>
          <dt>
            当前关注的会话
          </dt>
          <dd>
            observed-session
          </dd>
          <dt>
            桌宠总开关
          </dt>
          <dd>
            已启用
          </dd>
          <dt>
            所选桌宠
          </dt>
          <dd>
            1
          </dd>
          <dt>
            实例状态
          </dt>
          <dd>
            已启用
          </dd>
          <dt>
            绑定会话
          </dt>
          <dd>
            observed-session
          </dd>
          <dt>
            桌宠气泡
          </dt>
          <dd>
            已静音
          </dd>
        </dl>
        <p>
          可选口吻从主会话下一回合生效，代码与正式报告保持正常风格，不改变权限。
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </details>
</DocumentFragment>
`;

